          + "// The HTML tag functions — spec ch43 `§wac-html-tag-functions-sb9cij9`.\n"
          + "//\n"
          + "// `core.html` holds a function per HTML element, each answering `Node.Element` with its own name, one\n"
          + "// `Attr` per attribute written and its children as `kids`. A tag is a call (ch23), so `<p class=\"hi\">`\n"
          + "// is `html.p(class: \"hi\", kids: [])` once `html.p` is imported, and an attribute left out is `null`\n"
