          + "   * For a `<canvas>` that means the *backing store*, not the CSS box: one drawn 480 wide and\n"
          + "   * shown at `width: 100%` reports 0..479 whatever the window is doing. Anything else would make\n"
          + "   * click-to-zoom land near the click at one window size and visibly wrong at every other.\n"
          + "   */\n"
          + "  i32 x;\n"
          + "  i32 y;\n"
          + "\n"
          + "  Event of(string kind, string id, string value, i32 x, i32 y) {\n"
          + "    return Event(kind, id, value, x, y);\n"
          + "  }\n"
          + "}\n"
          + "\n"
          + "/**\n"
          + " * A file the user handed over, by picking it or dropping it.\n"
          + " *\n"
          + " * Separate from `FileResult` because a file that arrived this way has a *name* the application\n"
          + " * did not choose and usually wants — to echo it, to derive an output name from it, or to decide\n"
          + " * what it is.\n"
          + " */\n"
          + "/**\n"
          + " * What a child program wrote, once it has finished.\n"
