          + " * `recv` parks it on a socket, and the page's main thread — which is the *host* — stays free to\n"
          + " * run the real event loop and queue what arrives. So `waitAny` composes over it: a click or a\n"
          + " * five-second deadline is `waitAny([e.id], 5000)`, which is the thing callbacks make hard.\n"
          + " *\n"
