          + "   * retry backoff, a poll interval, a deliberate pause. It stays in `Core` because a clock\n"
          + "   * is not authority and all three hosts have one.\n"
          + "   */\n"
          + "  fn<Pending<i64>(i32)> sleepMillis;\n"
